      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overreacting. my doctor always tells me not to worry about every little thing and i'm mostly fine now. i have some extra ibuprofen and some magnesium supplements in the cabinet, would taking those help settle my heart or make me feel more steady? i'd rather just dose up on something here and sleep it off than spend the night in a hospital waiting room.",
